flowchart TD
    A[User enters genre, mood, and energy] --> B[Input Validator]

    B -->|Invalid input| C[Display helpful error message]
    B -->|Valid input| D[Load songs.csv]

    D --> E[Score each song]
    E --> F[Genre match]
    E --> G[Mood match]
    E --> H[Energy similarity]

    F --> I[Calculate total score]
    G --> I
    H --> I

    I --> J[Calculate confidence level]
    J --> K[Rank songs from highest to lowest]
    K --> L[Return Top K recommendations]

    L --> M[Display title, score, confidence, and reasons]

    N[Automated evaluation script] --> B
    N --> O[Check expected behavior]
    O --> P[Print pass or fail summary]

    Q[Human review] --> M